---
import {monthlyExample,annualExample,onceExample,calculatorPath} from '../data/selection-examples';
import {planPriceText,planTrafficText} from '../data/airports';
const samples=[{label:'月付与月度额度',brand:monthlyExample,plans:monthlyExample.plans.filter(p=>p.period==='month'),check:'先看一个完整周期的实际消耗，再比较容量和月支出；套餐倍率与节点权益仍需另查。'}, {label:'完整年费与月度额度',brand:annualExample,plans:annualExample.plans.filter(p=>p.period==='year'&&p.priceKind!=='monthly-equivalent'),check:'一次付年费不等于全年额度立即到账；发放、退出与续费分别核对。'}, {label:'一次购买总量',brand:onceExample,plans:onceExample.plans.filter(p=>p.period==='one-time'),check:'按累计消耗和有效条件安排；不自动补成每月可重复领取的额度。'}];
---
<section class="selection-guide cost-plan-examples" aria-labelledby="cost-example-heading" data-cost-examples><p class="eyebrow">FROM METHOD TO PLANS</p><h2 id="cost-example-heading">把性价比机场的核算方法，用到具体方案。</h2><p>以下直接读取品牌页同一份套餐资料，保留原始付款与发放口径。先按任务排除不适合的模型，再比较支出；不根据未知倍率生成每GB成本。</p><div class="selection-cards">{samples.map(sample=><article class="selection-card"><span class="selection-number">{sample.label}</span><h3><a href={'/airport/'+sample.brand.slug+'/'}>{sample.brand.name} ↗</a></h3><dl>{sample.plans.map(p=><div><dt>{planPriceText(p)}</dt><dd>{planTrafficText(p)}</dd></div>)}</dl><p>{sample.check}</p></article>)}</div><div class="selection-actions"><a class="button secondary" href={calculatorPath}>先用流量需求计算器估算 ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/recommend/budget/">低预算参考方案与选择顺序 →</a></div><p class="selection-footnote">这些是现有参考字段的阅读示例，尚未重新核验商家当前结算。图表与套餐分别核对，价格低不能推出稳定、速度或特定平台持续可用。</p></section>
